layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 17
text = "🎮 CONTROLS:
  • W / UP ARROW     : Accelerate & Drive
  • S / DOWN ARROW   : Brake & Reverse
  • A / D / ARROWS   : Steer Left & Right
  • SPACEBAR         : Supercharged Nitro Boost!
  • R / ENTER        : Quick Reset to Checkpoint

🏁 RACING RULES & MECHANICS:
  • Pass checkpoints in sequence to complete laps.
  • Pick up Solar Coins (yellow) to increase score & rewards.
  • Collect Nitro Cells (cyan) to restore +35 boost charge.
  • Watch out for obstacles: Cones (-15%), Tire Stacks (-35%), Barriers (-50%).
  • OUT OF BOUNDS: Leaving the track triggers a 2-second countdown! Steer back onto the asphalt before time runs out to avoid checkpoint recovery."

